{"sba-keyaki-8683":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n おはようございます\n \n \n \n \n 『お風呂入ったと思ったら入ってなかった』\n \n \n \n ってお母さんに言ったら\n 『え、入ったと思ってたの?』って普通に引かれました。\n \n \n \n \n \n いつもだったらいつ寝たのか覚えてるけど\n 今日は覚えてなかったよ〜      ♩♩♩\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日はベッドで寝る。ベッドで寝る。ベッドで寝る!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n スタッフさんから卒業のお祝いにもらったバナナ昨日見たら真っ黒でした。\n \n \n \n \n でも、美味しかった。♡\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3DBKWER1YK6TV6YQMPC5K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 今日も1日頑張りましょう"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-56474":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の井上梨名です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目シングル「自業自得」皆さんのもとにお届けすることができて嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲たくさん聴いてくれているかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJKMHED5D94FQPZJQG87N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJMRT6YN0X6V4D292H54N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJNTDKYRPBZ2RXSK3M9E9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらはアートワークの時！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人違ったドレスが本当に素敵なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お顔にたくさんキラキラ付けてもらったんですー！キラキラ大好きなので嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJPWSJF2V71M2SQ84W0RV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これキラキラ分かりやすいかもー\nまつ毛にもキラキラ乗せてもらってたんだー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の脳波はどんな意味があるんだろうなー\nブックレットもたくさん見てねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアルオープン後初の、SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんお邪魔しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアルオープンおめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も愛がこもった素敵な展示をして頂きました！\n一つ一つ本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJQZV721017VSDBR3XZX7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJS8KQXMPDNTHPQTWFVEF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人パネルは冬優花さんと隣でしたー！\nハートしましたよー！ぜひこの前で撮ってくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1JJTC1VQF6CR0787Y4KEH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、こちら！\nたくさん嬉しい言葉が書いてありました。\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お近くにお越しの際はぜひ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回ユニット曲「イザベルについて」は、サクラミーツメンバーなんです！\n気づいてた？みんなで嬉しいね！って言い合いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンス楽しみにしていてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいば〜い🦒"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-31722":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ381VZF0A5QSVHTHM5E1SD0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 前回の続きでお花ブログとなっております(^^)\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ381WYMMGJE6MJ9AF2N9JBF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 赤いお花！まるくて可愛い〜笑　紅白歌合戦、緊張しますが頑張ります🐕ありがとう〜！😁\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ381XYD2EAWJPZ8GDWGNFBX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 大きくて素敵なお花！！！私も元気をいただいてます😊こちらこそありがとうございます🙇🏻‍♀️\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ381Z1D44D9EHHHCCX1NE3B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 黄色って本当にハッピー！って色な気がします！✨こちらこそありがとう！嬉しいです😃\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38201ZM6PCJHYVN4SV92ER","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 赤と白のカラーになってるー！紅組として精一杯頑張ります！😊ありがとう〜！(ᯅ̈ )\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38211DT7HJ3EQDMRPGVN13","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n 三枚目シングルのカラー！白い薔薇もある！本番頑張ります！😍ありがとうね！うれしい！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3821ZJRWDH3VYP7EWSPMC1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ガーベラ好きなんです！素敵！本番楽しみたいと思います！😆ありがとうございます(^^)\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38231NVTK13TAJP73SN6KC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n こさかなと私宛に！一緒に撮れなくてすみません💦魚を書いてみましたーありがとう！！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ382478NWYQNG88ASYSW459","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n ひなこと一緒に♡ピンクの薔薇が可愛いです(^^)素敵なお花をありがとう〜😆😁\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38258FVM9P7B1WAZHZR5GB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 二期生宛に！ピンクで大きくて素敵💓メッセージもたくさんありがとうございます😆✨🎉\n \n \n \n いつも素敵なお花をありがとうございます💐\n レーン凄いねぇとファンの皆さんにも言っていただけて、私も本当に本当に有り難いことだなぁと噛み締めました。\n とっても嬉しいです！😆\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #297"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16772":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんブログの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんその４０６に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村の真実を暴露されたんよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅん１３歳の設定やんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２１歳って堂々とかかれたんよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、２１歳やのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールって言われたんよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなん言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんちゃ、、、いや、、何でもないです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはりんご王国の危機やでっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご王国ときゅんきゅん王国の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全面戦争やーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼＼\\\\٩( 'ω' )و //／／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっくら明日、戦ってくるわっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、王国民の皆さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喧嘩したらあかんよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな仲良くやでっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"